[22.275, "o", "txn_00005668 · visa:13.2 Cancelled Recurring Transaction\r\n"]
[22.315, "o", "  strategy:    accept (playbook: accept, confidence: high, llm via mock)\r\n"]
[22.355, "o", "  rationale:   Filed under visa:13.2 (Cancelled Recurring Transaction). Before the dispute, the model scored this charge at 92.3%, 49.9× a typical transaction. The score was driven by charged_after_cancel_request = yes (×1,668 odds), email_freemail = no (×0.75 odds), prior_approved_renewals = 2 (×1.27 odds). Playbook signals: the customer had already asked to cancel before this charge; established account (279.7 days old) with no IP/issuer country mismatch; 2 approved renewals of this subscription before the charge. Recommended action: accept. The customer asked to cancel before this charge, so the merchant is at fault.\r\n"]
[22.395, "o", "  key factors: charged_after_cancel_request, email_freemail, prior_approved_renewals, account_age_days\r\n"]
[22.435, "o", "  evidence:\r\n"]
[22.475, "o", "    - refund confirmation, or accept the chargeback without a response\r\n"]
